    "bookTitle": "Nehemiah",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 12,
    "summary": "The priests and Levites who came up from Babylon are named—The walls of Jerusalem are dedicated—The offices of priests and Levites are appointed in the temple.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
