        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Nehemiah 12:6",
        "book": "Nehemiah",
        "chapter": 12,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Sallu, Amok, Hilkiah, Jedaiah. These were the chief of the priests and of their brethren in the days of Jeshua.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 37,
            "end": 41
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Nehemiah 12:7",
        "book": "Nehemiah",
        "chapter": 12,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Moreover the Levites: Jeshua, Binnui, Kadmiel, Sherebiah, Judah, and Mattaniah, which was over the thanksgiving, he and his brethren.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 65,
            "end": 68
          },
          {
            "start": 80,
            "end": 89
          }
        ],
