        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Nehemiah 12:8",
        "book": "Nehemiah",
        "chapter": 12,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Also Bakbukiah and Unni, their brethren, were over against them in the watches.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 45
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Nehemiah 12:9",
        "book": "Nehemiah",
        "chapter": 12,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And Jeshua begat Joiakim, Joiakim also begat Eliashib, and Eliashib begat Joiada,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Nehemiah 12:10",
        "book": "Nehemiah",
        "chapter": 12,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
